{"4698980": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "CatchUp Showdown", "steam_appid": 4698980, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Welcome to Mr. Daruma's CatchUp Showdown!</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the climbing gameshow challenge of throwing a ball around with your friends in style to ascend Daruma's tower through increasingly harder stages. Drop the ball, and back down you go. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4698980/extras/e4616b0cc905efc102b680251479b201.avif?t=1788261238\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4698980/extras_big/e4616b0cc905efc102b680251479b201.avif?t=1788261238 width=1560 height=878 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Online co-op: Bring your friends to climb Mr. Daruma's tower together — or take it on alone. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Extensive first person controls: Duck, dive, jump, slide and more to make clutch saves and cool throws. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Leaderboards: Compare your scores and climbing time with all other groups. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Customization: You are best when you are someone else. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4698980/extras/81ff45386612657aa428fab01d00bbbf.poster.avif?t=1788261238\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4698980/extras/81ff45386612657aa428fab01d00bbbf.webm?t=1788261238\" type=\"video/webm; c